262
00:18:24.728 --> 00:18:27.689
Boss, this is Mr. Kim from Bonsan Group.

263
00:18:27.773 --> 00:18:29.108
Say I'm not there.

264
00:18:29.191 --> 00:18:32.820
Did Gi Joon come here yesterday?

265
00:18:33.487 --> 00:18:35.030
don't ask me

266
00:18:35.114 --> 00:18:38.033
Do I have to report every little thing to you?

267
00:18:38.951 --> 00:18:40.119
Gi Seok's order…

268
00:18:41.036 --> 00:18:44.039
Did Mr. Gu personally hire you for this?

269
00:18:44.998 --> 00:18:46.625
Yes. To hell with it!

270
00:18:46.708 --> 00:18:49.878
I'm already sneezing.
Clean up your own shit.

271
00:18:49.962 --> 00:18:51.171
Damn, I'm fed up already.

272
00:18:57.928 --> 00:18:59.138
come out

273
00:19:03.225 --> 00:19:04.351
You damn bastard.

274
00:19:05.018 --> 00:19:06.728
Do you not understand what is happening?

275
00:19:07.729 --> 00:19:09.356
Well, because

276
00:19:09.439 --> 00:19:12.568
No need to swear like that.

277
00:19:12.651 --> 00:19:14.528
How much does Gi Joon know?

278
00:19:16.613 --> 00:19:19.283
And don't make a fool of me here, damn it.

279
00:19:20.075 --> 00:19:22.953
Does Gi Joong know that Gu Joong Mo hired you?

280
00:19:24.246 --> 00:19:25.873
What did you expect?

281
00:19:26.707 --> 00:19:30.669
It's about Nam Gi Joon, okay?

282
00:19:30.752 --> 00:19:32.462
Do you think he gave me a choice?

283
00:19:32.546 --> 00:19:35.048
Is that all you can say, you bastard?

284
00:19:39.553 --> 00:19:40.679
What about you yourself?

285
00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:43.640
Would you go up against Nam Gi Joon?

286
00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:49.605
Devil.

287
00:19:54.776 --> 00:19:57.487
I'll kill that damn fortune teller.

288
00:20:06.413 --> 00:20:08.165
This is such a surprise.

289
00:20:08.248 --> 00:20:11.460
I can't believe you called me first.

290
00:20:16.423 --> 00:20:19.593
How long ago did we start drinking together here?

291
00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.722
But you didn't just call me for that.

292
00:20:24.264 --> 00:20:25.515
Tell me.

293
00:20:26.475 --> 00:20:29.186
Thanks to which we have
can you meet like this?

294
00:20:31.438 --> 00:20:35.150
Thanks to the rule,
which we agreed after the death of Mr. O.

295
00:20:36.818 --> 00:20:37.653
That's right.

296
00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:43.158
"Whoever attacks the other side,
he must pay for it."

297
00:20:44.243 --> 00:20:47.871
Whoever causes a mess must pay

298
00:20:48.372 --> 00:20:49.915
or your life,

299
00:20:50.707 --> 00:20:52.626
or something equivalent.

300
00:20:55.045 --> 00:20:56.505
For God's sake.

301
00:20:57.756 --> 00:20:59.841
It's enough to talk about it,

302
00:21:00.634 --> 00:21:02.052
let's get down to business.

303
00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:07.766
Even if this is your son,

304
00:21:08.976 --> 00:21:10.686
there can be no exceptions.

305
00:21:18.819 --> 00:21:19.903
always

306
00:21:21.488 --> 00:21:23.031
What the hell are you talking about?

307
00:21:23.573 --> 00:21:26.660
you know what i thought
just found out about Gi Seok?

308
00:21:27.244 --> 00:21:30.664
I thought: "Let's not attack.
That would be an accident.

309
00:21:30.747 --> 00:21:32.749
Accident at the hands of minors."

310
00:21:33.333 --> 00:21:35.002
didn't you hear me

311
00:21:35.627 --> 00:21:37.087
What are you doing?

312
00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:41.842
Your son, Jun Mo, hired Sim Song Won.

313
00:21:41.925 --> 00:21:45.220
That's why Gi Joon
crushed by NClean yesterday.

314
00:21:46.013 --> 00:21:49.474
You will have to
to answer for these words of yours.

315
00:21:49.558 --> 00:21:51.518
You think I didn't check the facts?

316
00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:56.898
now you understand
Why did I mention this rule?

317
00:21:58.442 --> 00:22:00.152
Yes, I understand.

318
00:22:01.069 --> 00:22:05.032
I hope you haven't forgotten
why did this rule come about in the first place.

319
00:22:06.074 --> 00:22:09.911
If only Nam Gi Joon
didn't screw it up 11 years ago

320
00:22:09.995 --> 00:22:12.205
there would be no need for this damn rule.

321
00:22:13.582 --> 00:22:15.208
what you just said

322
00:22:16.668 --> 00:22:18.086
will be a problem

323
00:22:19.254 --> 00:22:20.547
is it true or not.

324
00:22:21.923 --> 00:22:24.301
How dare you threaten my son's life?

325
00:22:26.053 --> 00:22:27.679
Just touch Jun Mo,

326
00:22:29.139 --> 00:22:30.766
do you think I'll keep quiet?

327
00:22:30.849 --> 00:22:31.892
Rightly.

328
00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:35.395
Because you know the truth
now you must act.

329
00:22:35.937 --> 00:22:37.647
That is, you have no choice.

330
00:22:38.398 --> 00:22:42.736
Or force your son to follow the rules,
or you must fight me.

331
00:22:45.906 --> 00:22:47.032
But know, Gu,

332
00:22:48.033 --> 00:22:51.161
that's not why I called you
to discuss it.

333
00:22:52.621 --> 00:22:57.542
Like I said, Gi Joon crushed NClean.

334
00:22:58.377 --> 00:22:59.753
Haven't you figured it out yet?

335
00:23:00.712 --> 00:23:02.381
Don't understand what awaits you?

336
00:23:04.424 --> 00:23:06.426
- Sir
- Are they inside?

337
00:23:38.834 --> 00:23:40.669
Let me ask one last time.

338
00:23:42.045 --> 00:23:44.714
You somehow
involved in Gi Seok's death?

339
00:23:45.382 --> 00:23:46.508
Nam Gi Joon!

340
00:23:48.718 --> 00:23:50.679
Just answer.

341
00:23:50.762 --> 00:23:52.013
You bastard!

342
00:23:52.097 --> 00:23:53.014
Gi Jun.

343
00:23:55.058 --> 00:23:57.269
The death of your brother is not your only concern.

344
00:23:58.437 --> 00:24:00.147
This is just as bad for Chuvun.

345
00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:01.982
I will take care of it.

346
00:24:02.065 --> 00:24:02.983
Does this mean

347
00:24:04.526 --> 00:24:06.862
that you will follow the rule?

348
00:24:06.945 --> 00:24:08.613
You are no longer working with us.

349
00:24:09.114 --> 00:24:11.575
And following the rules is not your business.

350
00:24:13.702 --> 00:24:16.246
But you'll stick to it, right?

351
00:24:20.667 --> 00:24:21.585
OK.

352
00:24:22.752 --> 00:24:25.547
We will figure it out
with Sim Sung-won and the little ones.

353
00:24:26.590 --> 00:24:28.091
Don't interfere.

354
00:24:28.175 --> 00:24:29.885
There is no need for this.

355
00:24:31.636 --> 00:24:32.554
I already know…

356
00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:38.143
who was behind it.

357
00:24:46.902 --> 00:24:48.153
These are not your instructions

358
00:24:49.196 --> 00:24:50.280
right?

359
00:24:55.744 --> 00:24:56.995
I think not.

360
00:25:08.673 --> 00:25:09.841
In that case

361
00:25:10.842 --> 00:25:12.469
you can do nothing.

362
00:25:13.637 --> 00:25:15.305
Just watch.

363
00:25:49.256 --> 00:25:51.675
Let me make amends to Jun Mo.

364
00:25:51.758 --> 00:25:54.970
Just say what you want.
Casino? My duty free shops?

365
00:25:55.053 --> 00:25:56.137
Or something else?

366
00:25:57.180 --> 00:26:00.767
You have to do something.

367
00:26:01.268 --> 00:26:03.520
You can't let Gi Joon

368
00:26:04.521 --> 00:26:06.064
destroy everything

369
00:26:10.068 --> 00:26:13.321
And what should I do? Kill him?

370
00:26:17.701 --> 00:26:19.202
If Jun Mo dies…

371
00:26:21.788 --> 00:26:23.415
this relationship is over.

372
00:26:24.916 --> 00:26:26.293
Mark my words.

373
00:26:27.294 --> 00:26:30.880
This will be our last meeting over a drink.

374
00:26:37.846 --> 00:26:38.888
take away

375
00:26:41.433 --> 00:26:43.935
Because if you start building a hotel now,

376
00:26:44.019 --> 00:26:45.854
you won't live to see it open.

377
00:26:48.523 --> 00:26:50.025
So why build it?

378
00:26:50.108 --> 00:26:52.068
Take better mine.

379
00:26:54.070 --> 00:26:55.405
Hotel "De'Cro".

380
00:26:58.199 --> 00:26:59.743
I will give it to you.

381
00:27:09.753 --> 00:27:10.879
Sir…

382
00:27:12.714 --> 00:27:14.007
Greetings, sir.

383
00:27:15.383 --> 00:27:16.635
Was it really you?

384
00:27:17.469 --> 00:27:18.345
What?

385
00:27:21.931 --> 00:27:22.766
Did you do that?

386
00:27:23.516 --> 00:27:24.559
Answer!

387
00:27:26.227 --> 00:27:29.105
how to answer
when i don't know what are you talking about?

388
00:27:30.482 --> 00:27:31.608
Nam Gi Seok.

389
00:27:33.109 --> 00:27:34.569
Did you do that?

390
00:27:40.367 --> 00:27:42.160
That's shit!

391
00:27:46.665 --> 00:27:47.499
Yes.

392
00:27:48.667 --> 00:27:50.085
I did it.

393
00:27:50.877 --> 00:27:51.795
And what?

394
00:27:54.714 --> 00:27:55.590
"So what?"

395
00:27:56.883 --> 00:27:57.717
"So what?"

396
00:27:58.718 --> 00:27:59.803
You're a jerk!

397
00:28:08.645 --> 00:28:11.898
Did you miss Cha?
Did you also eliminate Nam? Why?

398
00:28:17.737 --> 00:28:19.989
That scumbag humiliated me

399
00:28:20.699 --> 00:28:22.617
in front of my people.

400
00:28:24.244 --> 00:28:25.620
And that's it?

401
00:28:26.287 --> 00:28:28.331
This is not the first time you have been humiliated.

402
00:28:28.832 --> 00:28:32.502
You live like this all your life.
It doesn't matter, one more or less?

403
00:28:33.420 --> 00:28:34.337
Do you see?

404
00:28:37.132 --> 00:28:38.633
Even my own father

405
00:28:40.135 --> 00:28:43.680
exposes me to everyone
worthless piece of shit!

406
00:28:44.806 --> 00:28:47.642
That's why I try
prove your worth!

407
00:28:54.190 --> 00:28:55.483
Why prove something?

408
00:28:56.776 --> 00:28:58.319
If you are even unworthy,

409
00:28:59.404 --> 00:29:01.156
is that why you are not my son?

410
00:29:04.159 --> 00:29:05.201
Jun Mo.

411
00:29:05.702 --> 00:29:07.954
Don't you understand why I'm so angry?

412
00:29:31.853 --> 00:29:33.980
So you don't get killed by Nam Gi Joon,

413
00:29:34.481 --> 00:29:37.150
don't do anything without asking me.

414
00:29:38.109 --> 00:29:39.444
Of course?

415
00:29:44.365 --> 00:29:46.785
Careful, Chi Ho. Move your hips.

416
00:29:46.868 --> 00:29:48.661
Bam! One, two.

417
00:29:48.745 --> 00:29:49.871
Bam! Try it.

418
00:29:50.955 --> 00:29:52.499
Did you come to tell the ball?

419
00:29:53.500 --> 00:29:56.294
We have daytime classes only for children.

420
00:29:57.378 --> 00:29:58.254
Gi Jun.

421
00:30:07.388 --> 00:30:08.765
I was at the funeral.

422
00:30:10.141 --> 00:30:13.144
I thought I had to at least
to say goodbye to Gi Seok.

423
00:30:14.187 --> 00:30:17.982
But I didn't linger, because
didn't want to face those scumbags.

424
00:30:20.068 --> 00:30:21.694
Someone ordered Gi Suk, right?

425
00:30:23.321 --> 00:30:24.864
And you know who that is, huh?

426
00:30:27.408 --> 00:30:30.370
Gi Seok used to visit me before that.

427
00:30:32.372 --> 00:30:33.706
Did he say something?

428
00:30:35.083 --> 00:30:36.709
No, almost nothing.

429
00:30:37.460 --> 00:30:38.670
But I saw everything.

430
00:30:39.170 --> 00:30:40.755
Because something was wrong.

431
00:30:43.174 --> 00:30:44.384
So now

432
00:30:45.802 --> 00:30:48.847
I need a bull like my old one.

433
00:30:58.606 --> 00:31:00.066
Of course. Good.

434
00:31:02.861 --> 00:31:05.738
To make it,
it takes some time so…

435
00:31:10.159 --> 00:31:12.412
Here, take this first.

436
00:31:21.045 --> 00:31:23.631
It's not just anyone, we're talking about Mr. Nam.

437
00:31:24.591 --> 00:31:28.803
If you don't mind it,
then our people will not understand you.

438
00:31:28.887 --> 00:31:31.598
You suggest to start
a war with "Bonsan" or something?

439
00:31:37.103 --> 00:31:40.523
- We won't win anything.
- If you create such a precedent...

440
00:31:40.607 --> 00:31:41.441
Ahoy!

441
00:31:44.527 --> 00:31:45.612
I'm tired

442
00:32:19.687 --> 00:32:20.605
Greetings.

443
00:32:22.732 --> 00:32:23.608
What happened?

444
00:32:24.442 --> 00:32:25.693
what are you doing here

445
00:32:26.653 --> 00:32:28.279
I am with Mr. President.

446
00:32:29.656 --> 00:32:30.823
How is he?

447
00:32:34.160 --> 00:32:36.079
OK. What is the matter?

448
00:32:36.829 --> 00:32:37.914
Tell me better.

449
00:32:42.335 --> 00:32:43.670
I say, tell me.

450
00:32:48.007 --> 00:32:50.343
I already said, didn't I?

451
00:32:51.636 --> 00:32:53.513
After the fight with Gu Jun Mo…

452
00:32:54.847 --> 00:32:56.516
He was killed that evening.

453
00:32:58.810 --> 00:33:01.646
I understand what we have been waiting for
the end of the funeral

454
00:33:02.146 --> 00:33:04.440
but it's time for Mr. Chairman to do something.

455
00:33:05.858 --> 00:33:08.778
He knows that it was Gu Jun Mo.

456
00:33:10.446 --> 00:33:11.614
What?

457
00:33:11.698 --> 00:33:15.451
Our job is to carry out the boss's decision.

458
00:33:15.535 --> 00:33:18.413
So he doesn't want to do anything?
And you don't mind?

459
00:33:18.496 --> 00:33:19.330
Agov.

460
00:33:19.831 --> 00:33:21.207
don't forget

461
00:33:22.458 --> 00:33:24.002
who are you here

462
00:33:24.794 --> 00:33:25.712
Aha.

463
00:33:26.879 --> 00:33:27.964
I know my place.

464
00:33:30.717 --> 00:33:32.218
You probably like it.

465
00:33:34.721 --> 00:33:37.056
Because you will soon take over Gi Seok's position.

466
00:33:48.943 --> 00:33:49.944
Mr. Choi.

467
00:33:51.696 --> 00:33:53.448
How disgusting to contemplate.

468
00:33:55.366 --> 00:33:57.160
I teach him manners.

469
00:33:57.243 --> 00:34:00.621
But you shouldn't beat him,
like it's a gang showdown.

470
00:34:12.550 --> 00:34:16.095
This is the company's job,
and it does not concern you.

471
00:34:22.935 --> 00:34:24.395
And yet, Mr. Choi.

472
00:34:26.105 --> 00:34:29.692
do you really think
that you won't win anything, only lose?

473
00:34:51.589 --> 00:34:52.507
<i>These are my affairs.</i>

474
00:34:53.424 --> 00:34:54.926
Do not interfere.

475
00:34:55.593 --> 00:34:57.720
The company wants to forget about all this.

476
00:34:59.013 --> 00:35:00.556
Follow this decision.

477
00:35:01.641 --> 00:35:02.475
Of course.

478
00:35:03.810 --> 00:35:06.062
Someone already told me that.

479
00:35:06.562 --> 00:35:09.065
We just have to follow the boss's decision.

480
00:35:10.358 --> 00:35:14.362
But I never
I will not respect such a person as my boss.

481
00:35:18.783 --> 00:35:20.326
It's not just your business.

482
00:35:21.744 --> 00:35:23.204
She is mine too.

483
00:35:34.257 --> 00:35:36.259
Grandpa, I'm starving.

484
00:35:44.058 --> 00:35:47.103
<i>Name is Gu Jun Mo.</i>

485
00:35:47.186 --> 00:35:50.106
Manager of the company "Bonsan",
director of the De'Cro hotel.

486
00:35:50.189 --> 00:35:52.024
The car is a white Maserati Ghibli.

487
00:35:52.108 --> 00:35:55.278
Number plate 26D 7123.

488
00:35:55.361 --> 00:35:56.445
We publish.

489
00:35:56.529 --> 00:35:58.156
{\an8}GU JUNG MO
DIRECTOR OF DE'CRO HOTEL

490
00:36:04.162 --> 00:36:05.746
Let me know if you see him.

491
00:36:05.830 --> 00:36:07.081
{\an8}GU JUNG MO
DIRECTOR OF "DE'CRO"

492
00:36:07.165 --> 00:36:08.749
- Oh, look.
- What is there?

493
00:36:11.919 --> 00:36:14.297
It's not him. Let's look further.

494
00:36:14.463 --> 00:36:15.631
{\an8}- EVERYDAY
- IDENTICAL

495
00:36:15.715 --> 00:36:18.009
{\an8}CEMETERY MANAGER
THE SEARCH FOR GU JUNG MO

496
00:36:18.092 --> 00:36:19.177
30 MILLION WON

497
00:36:19.260 --> 00:36:20.595
CHEONDAM, APKUJEON

498
00:36:20.678 --> 00:36:22.263
The number is different!

499
00:36:22.346 --> 00:36:24.056
{\an8}They are already trading.

500
00:36:24.140 --> 00:36:25.683
Does he go to church?

501
00:36:35.610 --> 00:36:37.236
26D 7123

502
00:36:43.242 --> 00:36:44.452
grandfather

503
00:36:47.371 --> 00:36:48.206
Curse.

504
00:36:51.542 --> 00:36:53.586
Here, Gu Jun Mo has been found!

505
00:36:56.088 --> 00:36:58.049
Ah, we found him!

506
00:36:58.716 --> 00:36:59.550
Really?

507
00:37:08.392 --> 00:37:09.227
<i>Sir.</i>

508
00:37:10.937 --> 00:37:12.230
<i>There is a location.</i>

509
00:37:12.313 --> 00:37:17.360
DE'CRO HOTEL

510
00:37:19.237 --> 00:37:22.990
WITHOUT MERCY

511
00:37:28.913 --> 00:37:31.415
<i>I knew he would do something like that someday.</i>

512
00:37:34.961 --> 00:37:36.462
<i>Is this really Jun Mo?</i>

513
00:37:37.171 --> 00:37:38.756
are you sure

514
00:37:38.839 --> 00:37:41.968
<i>Yes, sure.</i>
<i>Gu Joon Mo, Director of Bonsan<i>.</i>

515
00:37:42.468 --> 00:37:45.846
<i>He hired NClean,</i>
<i>to kill Nam Gi-seok.</i>

516
00:37:46.514 --> 00:37:49.475
<i>I knew he would do something like that someday.</i>

517
00:37:49.558 --> 00:37:51.102
Does Gi Joon know about this?

518
00:37:51.727 --> 00:37:54.397
<i>Yes, it already crushed NClean.</i>

519
00:37:56.023 --> 00:37:57.483
but sir

520
00:37:57.984 --> 00:38:01.070
this is probably only the beginning, not the end.

521
00:38:02.363 --> 00:38:07.326
<i>11-year-old rule</i>
<i>set when Nam Gi Joon left.</i>

522
00:38:07.410 --> 00:38:11.289
<i>Now that he's back,</i>
<i>time to establish a new rule.</i>

523
00:38:11.789 --> 00:38:12.623
That is?

524
00:38:13.374 --> 00:38:15.042
<i>I want to say,</i>

525
00:38:15.543 --> 00:38:17.169
<i>what is possible according to the old rule</i>

526
00:38:17.253 --> 00:38:20.339
make Gu Jun Mo pay with his life,

527
00:38:20.423 --> 00:38:24.385
or a deal can be made
with Mr. Gu and forget about all this,

528
00:38:24.468 --> 00:38:25.344
or maybe

529
00:38:26.971 --> 00:38:28.222
like 11 years ago

530
00:38:28.306 --> 00:38:31.976
you can turn everything around
from head to toe and take everything for yourself.

